B.aIl=new A.bA("weapon_melee_Spoon","Spoon",B.ak,"Scoop: When you Succeed on the Technique, Scoop the target. While scooped, they cannot make attacks of opertunity, and are restrained in a free space adjacent to you, and move with you. At the end of your turn, drop the target prone, in a free space in range of your techinque.\nFling: [Reaction] During your turn, make a ranged attack vs Dex targeting 1 enemy range 4/8. on success, deal {Source d6} bludgeoning damage. If you have a scooped enemy, Regardless of success, dash the scooped enemy to a free space within 1 of the target and drop them prone, On Success, also deal damage to the scooped enemy. ","1","{Source d8}","{Source d10}","Str")
