B.aIf=new A.bA("weapon_melee_Scissors ","Scissors",B.ak,"On Success, until the start of your next turn, choose to either halve the targets speed or you and your allies have +1 to results on Str, Dex, or Vit defense caused by the target.","1","{Source d8}","{Source d10}","Str")
