B.aHM=new A.bA("weapon_melee_Umbrella","Umbrella",B.ak,"Float: After succeeding on a weapon attack, until the start of your next turn, At the start of each turn, dash {Source/3} to a free space.\nOpen[Reaction] Before you or an adjacent Ally is attacked by a Ranged Attack, you may use your reaction to give Advantage on the Defense Roll to you and all allies targeted by the attack.","1","{Source d8}","{Source d10}","Str")
B.aHI=new A.bA("weapon_melee_Bubble_Shield","Bubble Shield",B.ak,"On Success, Until your next turn, Allies within {Half Source} of you may use your shield when damaged.","1","{Source d8}","{Source d10}","Str")
B.aIc=new A.bA("weapon_melee_Chainsaw","Chainsaw",B.ak,"[Reaction] During Yours or an Enemies Turn: Start your chainsaw and begin concentrating: While Concentrating, on success with a chainsaw attack, give the target {Half Source} d6 bleed. You cannot use your chainsaw other than as an improvised weapon if its not started. Other creatures can start a chainsaw but must succeed a create skill.","1","{Source d10}","{Source d12}","Str")
B.aHO=new A.bA("weapon_melee_Skateboard","Skateboard",B.ak,"On Success, After dealing damage, Move {Source} this movement can cause Opportunity Attacks. Until the start of your next turn, You have advantage on defenses caused by opportunity attacks And the target of the attack must make an opportunity attack if able. This includes the movement from this technique","1","{Source d8}","{Source d10}","Dex")
