B.aaC=new A.cK("implement_Bones","Bones","After you succeed on a Status check, until the end of your next turn, Your allies gain +1 to attack results against the targets.",B.d_)
B.aao=new A.cK("implement_Teeth","Teeth","After you succeed on an attack, choose 1 of the targets. Until the end of your next turn, you may target your [Action] from that enemy's space.",B.d_)
B.aaw=new A.cK("implement_Dice","Dice","When you get Problems on an Attack roll, you may roll 2d6. If you roll a 7, succeed instead and deal 2d6 extra damage. If you roll 2, deal 2d6 damage to yourself.",B.d_)
B.aaq=new A.cK("implement_Tome","Tome","Gain +1 to Results of Concentration Checks caused by damage.\n[Reaction] After you fail a concentration check, you may spend your reaction to reroll the check.",B.dj)
B.aal=new A.cK("implement_Staff","Staff","When you use an action, If there aren't any enemies adjacent to you, you may target the ability as if you were standing in a free space within 2 of you.",B.dj)
B.aaz=new A.cK("implement_Keyboard_Pants","Keyboard Pants","Range +1/+2 [Action], your next {Level /2} attacks using your [Action] gains the Proxy effect as if you had spent a reaction. Proxy [Reaction] When you make an Attack and there are no enemies adjacent to you, you may spend your reaction to target the ability from the location of an ally.",B.dj)
