B.a_Y=new A.E("feature_spirit_disruptive_spirit","Disruptive Spirit","Spaces adjacent to your spirit are difficult terrain for enemies. You and your allies have a +1 to attacks and status checks against enemies adjacent to your spirit. This doesn't include your spirit attacks. ")
