B.a2e=new A.ay("feature_tornado","Tornado","[Action] Target a 2 space radius within 6, and make a Ranged Attack vs Wis. On Success, deal {Source d6} damage to enemies there and dash all characters in the tornado to a free space within {Half Source}. Create a tornado there for as long as you remain concentrating. When a character starts its turn in the tornado, or enters it for the first time during their turn, make a Status Check vs Wis, On Success Deal {Half Source d6}, knock the target prone, and dash the target to a free space with {Half Source}. When you or allies enter, On success, they take no damage and aren\u2019t knocked prone, on Problems, they are affected as if you succeed against an enemy.\n\n[Reaction] During your turn while concentrating, Spend your reaction to move your tornado {Source} spaces. For each creature that the tornado passes over, make the status check against them, targeting no creature more than once.  ",B.G,B.af2,!1,B.nn,!0,null,null,B.D)
