B.aH7=new A.dc(B.G,"universal_combo","Combo","On Success, gain +1d6 damage for each time you have succeeded in attacking with this ability without failing up to a Max of {Source d6}. On failure you lose your combo bonus and start over. Abilities that target multiple creatures do not increase combo per target, only per attack.")
B.aHa=new A.dc(B.G,"universal_death","Death","On Success, also deal the damage to a character range 4 who wasn\u2019t targeted by the ability. No other effects from the ability are applied. You must target a character with this effect, and may target yourself or allies. If there is no valid character, you must target yourself and the damage ignores shield and resistance. ")
B.aGV=new A.dc(B.G,"universal_earth","Earth","On Success, the target\u2019s speed is reduced by {Half Source} and you gain a +1 to defense results until the start of your next turn. On Problems, you may gain a +1 to defense results and -2 speed until the start of your next turn.")
B.aHh=new A.dc(B.G,"universal_fire","Fire","On Success, give the targets {Half Source} d6 Burn vs Dex. You may give yourself {Vitality}d6 Burn to increase the burn against the targets by the same amount.")
B.aGT=new A.dc(B.G,"universal_gravity","Gravity","On Success, Before or after any other effects, either dash one of the targets to a free space within {Half Source} of them, or dash you and allies within 1 to a free space within {Half Source}.")
B.aH5=new A.dc(B.G,"universal_hate","Hate","On Success, you may deal yourself up to {Source d12} damage to increase the damage to the targets by the same amount.")
B.aHk=new A.dc(B.G,"universal_inspiring","Inspiring","After you Succeed with the attack, 1 ally within 6 spaces gains {Source d6} Shield.")
B.aH9=new A.dc(B.G,"universal_illness","Illness","On Success, give one of the targets {Half Source} d6 bleed, While they have this bleed, their speed is reduced by {Half Source}. You may give yourself this bleed, if you do also give it to enemies range 1 of you.")
B.aHi=new A.dc(B.G,"universal_jamming","Jamming","After you Success with the attack, and if the target was concentrating, deal {Half Source d6} extra damage. The target has disadvantage on their concentration check for this attack. If the target begins concentrating before the start of your next turn, they must immediately make a concentration check as if they had taken damage.")
B.aHd=new A.dc(B.G,"universal_life","Life","On Success, Target an ally range 3 and heal them {Half Source d6}.")
B.aHc=new A.dc(B.G,"universal_lightning","Lightning","On Success, Knock the targets prone and Deal {Half Source d6} damage to all prone enemies within 3 of the targets excluding the targets. If the targets were prone before the attack, damage them as well.")
B.aHe=new A.dc(B.G,"universal_power_attack","Power Attack","You may gain disadvantage on the attack and deal {Source d6} extra damage on success. If you do, you must roll with disadvantage even if you have advantage.")
B.aHb=new A.dc(B.G,"universal_pull","Pull","After you Success with an attack, the attack pulls enemies toward you {2*Source} for melee attacks and {Source} for ranged attacks.")
B.aH2=new A.dc(B.G,"universal_push","Push","After you Succeed with an attack, You may push an enemy up to {2*Source} for melee attacks and {Source} for ranged attacks.")
B.aH_=new A.dc(B.G,"universal_rainbow","Rainbow","When you make the attack, you may choose to target any defense.")
B.aHm=new A.dc(B.G,"universal_reaching","Reaching","Increase the range of the ability attack by {Half Source}.")
B.aH0=new A.dc(B.G,"universal_reckless","Reckless","you may gain advantage on attacks and disadvantage on defenses until the start of your next turn.")
B.aGU=new A.dc(B.G,"universal_scratch","Scratch","When you miss with a Melee Attack, Deal the target {Source /3 d6} Damage.")
B.aH3=new A.dc(B.G,"universal_skirmish","Skirmish","After you make an attack, until the end of your turn, you may move without provoking attacks of opportunity.")
B.aGY=new A.dc(B.G,"universal_slowing","Slowing","On Success, the targets reduce their speed by {Half Source}, and reduce their range with ranged Attacks by {Half Source} until the start of your next turn.")
B.aHf=new A.dc(B.G,"universal_water","Water","On Success, Until the start of your next turn, your allies deal {Half Source d6} extra damage on attacks or damaging Status Checks against the targets.")
B.aH6=new A.dc(B.G,"universal_weed","Weed","On Success, Before or after any of the other effects, place difficult terrain in the targets\u2019 spaces.")
B.aH4=new A.dc(B.G,"universal_wind","Wind","On Success, After attacking, Dash you and the targets up to {Half Source} in the same direction.")
