B.awT=new A.bP("Pawns","Instead of a normal chump, you have {Their Vitality} Pawns with 1 HP each. Whenever they gain shield they gain 1 shield, blocking 1 attack. If they have spectral or gain Resistance to all, they instead have 2 HP.",B.a0,!1)
B.awQ=new A.bP("Melee","HP {4 * Level * Their Vitality}. [Minion] Make a Melee Attack vs Str targeting 1 enemy range 1. On Success, deal {Half points d8} damage.",B.a0,!1)
B.awy=new A.bP("Range","HP {3 * Level * Their Vitality}. [Minion] Make a Ranged Attack vs Dex targeting 1 enemy range 6/12. On Success, deal {Half points d6} damage.",B.a0,!1)
B.aww=new A.bP("Repair","HP {2 * Level * Their Vitality}. Repair [Minion] Make a status check targeting an adjacent Ally. On Success: Heal {Half points d8}.",B.a0,!1)
B.ax3=new A.bP("Shielding","HP {2 * Level * Their Vitality}. Shield [Minion] Make a status check targeting a range 1 ally. On success, they gain {Half points d6} shield.",B.a0,!1)
B.awP=new A.bP("Familiar","HP {3 * Level * Their Vitality}. [Minion] You may target your abilities and skills from your minion's space. When you do, gain a +1 to the result of attacks, skills or status checks.",B.a0,!1)
B.ax8=new A.bP("Creation","HP {3 * Level * Their Vitality}. [Minion] Trigger a combat feature action with a source of {points / 4}. Choose the combat feature when you choose those.",B.a0,!1)
