B.awk=new A.d6("source_psionics","Psionics","The character uses their mind to alter reality. They have {2 * Power * points} Max Psi Points, regaining half after each encounter. When using a feature, They must spend at least 1 Psi Point and may spend up to {Power} Psi Points as the Source Value, and they may trigger one of their psi powers. They pick {points / 4} psi powers. You may use an Implement gaining any implement effects. If you do, you require that type of implement to use the feature.","You may spend 2 Psi Points to gain advantage on a skill you are proficient in or an Int, Wis, or Cha defense check. If an ally you can see is making a skill check that you have proficiency in, you may spend 2 Psi Points and that character rolls using your skill rather than their own.","Regain {Power} Psi Points.","-1 on checks made from Psionic abilities, and to trigger any of your Psi Powers you must make and succeed on a Defense vs Int first.","Psi Points Spent",B.js,"epic_source_psionics",!0,"Psi Points","{2 * Power * points}",B.akm,B.a0,"{points / 4}")
