B.aIg=new A.bA("weapon_ranged_shotgun","ShotGun",B.bm,"Being adjacent to enemies does not give you disadvantage with Shotgun, but allies provide cover to enemies. When the target is at short range, deal {Half Source d6} extra damage.","3 / 6","{Source d6}","{Source d8}","Dex")
B.aId=new A.bA("weapon_ranged_rifle","Rifle",B.bm,"On Success, If you haven't moved or dashed this turn, deal {Half Source d6} extra damage.","10 / 20","{Source d6}","{Source d8}","Dex")
B.aHW=new A.bA("weapon_ranged_carbine","Carbine",B.bm,"On Success, If the target was successfully attack by your ally this round, Deal {Half Source d6} extra damage.","6 / 12","{Source d6}","{Source d8}","Dex")
